  "releaseNotes": "Reuse one request-local MVC filter-context list while keeping filter execution order stable. Bind successful client operation and model-shape resolution to the exact loaded contract snapshot; revalidate after refresh. Preserve parallel-request isolation, authorization, short circuits, exceptions, argument mutation, the 4.0.x wire format, audit and masking integrations. See CHANGELOG.md.",
